                "title": "South Beach Solid Brass Lever",
                "description": "The Retro South Beach Door Lever is the simple answer to the vintage design aesthetic that is so popular. This Omnia made solid brass door handle is basic enough to effortlessly add just the right amount of retro detailing to your rooms; and also because its design is so simple, the South Beach Solid Brass Lever is capable of beautifully integrating into whatever furnishing you have without having to overhaul your entire décor.\r\n",
